{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"MediaWiki REST revision HTML, sanitized","nodeCount":393,"content":[{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwAQ"},"children":[{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwAg"},"children":[{"type":"div","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Similar Article"]}]},"This article is about ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Roblox Core Pack - Badlands Heist"]},". You may be looking for the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Cowboy","title":"Cowboy"},"children":["Cowboy"]},"."]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[]}]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwBA"},"children":[{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwBg"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Roblox_Core_Pack_-_Badlands_Heist"},"children":["Roblox Core Pack - Badlands Heist"]},"\n"]},{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwBw"},"children":["\n\n\n"]},{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[]},{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwCQ"},"children":["\n\n"]},"\n","\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwDA"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Description"},"children":["Description"]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["The ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Roblox Core Pack - Badlands Heist"]}," is an official Roblox toy that was released in July 2021. The toy contains the Level 5 ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Cowboy","title":"Cowboy"},"children":["Cowboy"]},". When you buy the toy, one redeemable code is given, which allows you to get the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.roblox.com/catalog/6532550987"},"children":["Withered Top Hat"]}," accessory on Roblox. You can also buy the ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Roblox Core Pack - Badlands Heist"]}," with two mystery figures, one from the Series 10 and the other from Series 8 of the Roblox Toy line. The toy is recommended for ages 6+ and is not suitable for children under 3 years old."]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwEg"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Official_Description"},"children":["Official Description"]},"\n",{"type":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"type":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Online"]},"\n",{"type":"dl","props":{},"children":[{"type":"dd","props":{},"children":["From the shadows of BelowNatural's Tower Defense Simulator, this well-disguised desperado has the firepower and nerve to cut down any zombies in his sights, before they even know what hit ‘em. Conditioned to the rugged Badlands terrain, he's trigger-ready to wipe his enemies off the map, save the day, and tell the tale."]}]}]},"\n",{"type":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["On Pack"]},"\n",{"type":"dl","props":{},"children":[{"type":"dd","props":{},"children":["From BelowNatural's thrilling Tower Defense Simulator, this well-disguised desperado has the firepower to cut down any zombies in his sights."]}]}]}]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwHA"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{"id":"Prices_.26_Stores"},"children":[]},"Prices & Stores"]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["Prices vary by country due to shipping costs and local currency. Generally, it costs around $6.99-$12.97 in the US, £9.70 in the UK and €11.58 in the EU. There may be additional costs if you buy this pack with two mystery figures."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["The stores in which you can buy the ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Roblox Core Pack - Tower Defense Simulator"]}," depends on country. The toy is subject to availability."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["The following list is a selection of the online stores that you can buy this item from. This is not meant to be a comprehensible list:"]},"\n\n",{"type":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"type":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.walmart.com/ip/Roblox-Action-Collection-Tower-Defense-Simulator-Badlands-Heist-Core-2-Mystery-Figure-Bundle-Includes-Exclusive-Virtual-Item/107178674"},"chil